# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CORE ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 
# This file contains the MINIMUM required environment variables
# to run the Consciousness Revolution platform locally.
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.core.example .env
# 2. Update the values below
# 3. Run: npm run verify:setup
#
# For advanced features (AI, payments, etc.), see .env.example
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. UNIVERSE KEY (Required)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unique identifier for your local instance
# Generate a UUID v4 at: https://www.uuidgenerator.net/
# Or the onboarding script will generate one for you
UNIVERSE_KEY=d29fc25b-c78c-4624-8106-d2b112b06024

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. NODE ENVIRONMENT (Required)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: development | production | test
NODE_ENV=development

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. SERVER PORT (Required)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Port for the local development server
PORT=3000

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# THAT'S IT FOR CORE SETUP! 🎉
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# The platform will run with just these 3 variables.
# 
# OPTIONAL: Add more features by uncommenting sections below
# or see .env.example for the full list (40+ integrations)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: Database (for persistent storage)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase - Free tier available at https://supabase.com
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: AI Integration (for intelligent features)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAI - For GPT models
# Get key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Groq - For fast, free inference
# Get key: https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk-your-key-here

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: GitHub Integration (for repo management)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal Access Token
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: repo, read:org
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your-token-here

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: Payment Processing (for monetization)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PayPal Sandbox (for testing)
# Get keys: https://developer.paypal.com/dashboard/
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=your-sandbox-client-id
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=your-sandbox-secret

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NEED MORE INTEGRATIONS?
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# See .env.example for the complete list:
# - Anthropic Claude
# - Discord
# - Stripe
# - Firebase
# - AWS services
# - Blockchain integrations
# - And 30+ more!
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
